### Feature GarmentTypes — UPDATE PUT / PATCH (JWT + RBAC)
@baseUrl = http://localhost:4000
# access_token: npm run dev:token -- admin  (o POST /api/sesion/login desde ISS-15)
@token = pega-aqui-el-access-token

### PUT
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/tipos-prenda/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Sábanas",
  "description": "Sábanas de algodón y poliéster"
}

### PATCH
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/tipos-prenda/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "Sábanas de todos los tamaños"
}
